<title>POLAND: KPW clears new issue of Sokolow.</title>
<headline>KPW clears new issue of Sokolow.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) has cleared for public trade the new issue of between 2.75 million to 5.5 million shares of food producer Sokolow, the KPW said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p> Tranches		  No Of Shares	   Subscription</p>
<p>			     Offered		  Period</p>
<p> Open			2,750,000		October 1-3</p>
<p> Closed		    2,750,000		October 1-3</p>
<p>No of existing shares: 27,500,000.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
